{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-102-1","title":"Psalms 102:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The prophet in his prayer makes a grievous complaint. 12 He takes comfort in the eternity, and mercy of God. 18 The mercies of God are to be recorded. 23 He sustains his weakness by the unchangeableness of God.</p>\n<p>A.M. cir. 3464. B.C. cir. 540. (Title.) A Prayer.This psalm was evidently composed towards the close of the Babylonian captivity; and probably by the prophet Daniel.</p>\n<p>of. or, for. overwhelmed. 12:5; 61:2; 69:1,2; 142:2,3; 143:4; La 3:18-20; Mr 14:33,34 Lu 22:44; Heb 5:7 poureth. 42:4; 62:8; 77:3; 142:2; 1Sa 1:15,16 Hear. 5:2; 55:1-5; 57:1-3; 130:1,2; 41:1,2; 143:7; 145:19 let my. 18:6; Ex 2:23; Jud 10:16; 1Sa 9:16; 2Ch 30:27; La 3:8,44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-2","title":"Psalms 102:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Hide. 13:1; 27:9; 69:17; 88:14; 104:29; 143:7; Job 34:29; Isa 8:17; 43:2 1Co 10:13 incline. 71:2; 88:2-18 in the day. 22:19; 40:13; 70:1; Job 7:21; Isa 65:24; Ac 12:5-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-3","title":"Psalms 102:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>my days. 37:20; 119:83; Jas 4:14 like smoke. or, (as some read) into smoke. my bones. 22:14,15; 31:10; 38:3; Job 30:30; La 1:13; 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-4","title":"Psalms 102:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>heart. 6:2,3; 42:6; 55:4,5; 69:20; 77:3; 143:3,4; Job 6:4; 10:1; La 3:13,20 Mt 26:37,38 withered. 11; 37:2; Isa 40:7 so that. 9; 1Sa 1:7,8; Ezr 10:6; Ac 9:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-5","title":"Psalms 102:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>the voice. 6:6,8; 32:3,4; 38:8-10; Job 19:20; Pr 17:22; La 4:8 skin. or, flesh.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-6","title":"Psalms 102:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>like. Job 30:29,30; Isa 38:14; Mic 1:8 a pelican. Isa 34:11-15; Zep 2:14; *marg: Re 18:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-7","title":"Psalms 102:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>watch. 22:2; 77:4; 130:6; De 28:66,67; Job 7:13-16; Mr 14:33-37 alone. 38:11; La 3:28-30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-8","title":"Psalms 102:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Mine. 31:11-13; 55:3; 69:9,10,20; 89:51; Ro 15:3 mad. 2:1; Lu 6:11; Ac 7:54; 26:11 sworn. Ac 23:12-35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-9","title":"Psalms 102:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>I Have. 69:21; Isa 44:20; La 3:15,16; Mic 1:10; 7:17 mingled. 42:3; 80:5; Job 3:24; La 3:48,49</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-10","title":"Psalms 102:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Because. 38:3,18; 39:11; 90:7-9; La 1:18; 3:39-42; 5:16; Da 9:8-14; Ro 3:19 thou hast. 30:6,7; 73:18-20; 147:6; 1Sa 2:7,8; 2Ch 25:8; 2Co 4:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-11","title":"Psalms 102:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>My days. 3; 39:5,6; 109:23; 144:4; Job 14:2; Ec 6:12; Jas 4:14 I am withered. 4; Isa 40:6-8; Jas 1:10; 1Pe 1:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-12","title":"Psalms 102:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>thou. 24-27; 9:7; 90:1,2; De 33:27; Isa 44:6; 60:15; La 5:19; Heb 13:8 Re 1:17,18 thy remembrance. 135:13; Ex 3:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-13","title":"Psalms 102:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Thou. 7:6; 44:26; 51:18; 69:35,36; Isa 14:32; 60:1,10-14; Jer 31:10-12,23 Zec 1:12,13; 2:10-12 the set. Ezr 1:1-11; Isa 40:2; Da 9:2-27; 12:9,12,13; Ac 1:7; Ga 4:4 2Pe 3:8,12; Re 11:15-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-14","title":"Psalms 102:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>79:1,7-10; 137:5,6; Ezr 1:5; 3:1-3; 7:27; Ne 1:3; 2:3,17; 4:2,6,10 Da 9:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-15","title":"Psalms 102:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>67:2-4; 68:31,32; 72:11; 86:9; 138:4; 1Ki 8:43; Isa 55:5; 60:3-22 Zec 8:20-23; Re 11:15; 21:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-16","title":"Psalms 102:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>When. 51:18; 69:35; 147:2; Isa 2:2,3; 14:26; 66:18; Jer 31:4; 33:7 he shall. 97:6; Isa 60:1,2,7; 61:3; Mic 2:9; Zec 2:6-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-17","title":"Psalms 102:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>He will. 9:18; 72:12; De 4:29; 32:36; Ne 1:6,11; 2:1-8; Jer 29:11-14 Da 9:3-21 not despise. 22:24; 69:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-18","title":"Psalms 102:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>This. 71:18; 78:4-6; Ex 17:14; De 31:19-32:44; Job 19:23,24; Da 9:2 Joh 20:31; Ro 15:4; 1Co 10:11; 2Ti 3:16,17; 2Pe 1:15 the people. 22:30,31; 45:16,17; Isa 43:7,21; 65:17-19; 2Co 5:17,18; Eph 2:10 1Pe 2:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-19","title":"Psalms 102:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>For he. 14:2; 33:13,14; De 26:15; 1Ki 8:39,43; 2Ch 16:9 the height. Job 22:12; Heb 8:1,2; 9:23,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-20","title":"Psalms 102:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>To hear. 79:11; 146:7; Ex 2:23-25; 3:7; 2Ki 13:4,22,23; Job 24:12; Isa 14:17 Isa 61:1-3; Jer 51:34,35; Zec 9:9-12 to loose. 2Ch 33:11-13; Jer 51:32-34; Ac 12:6-11 those that are appointed to. Heb. the children of. Eph 2:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-21","title":"Psalms 102:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>9:13,14; 22:22; 51:14,15; 79:13; Isa 51:11; Eph 2:4-7; 3:21; 1Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-22","title":"Psalms 102:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>72:8-11; Ge 49:10; Isa 49:22,23; 60:3-22; Ho 1:9-11; Zec 8:20-23 Mt 24:14; Ro 15:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-23","title":"Psalms 102:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>He weakened. Heb. He afflicted. 89:38-47; 2Th 2:3-12; 1Ti 4:1-3; 2Ti 3:1-17; Re 11:2-19; 12:13-17 shortened. Job 21:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-24","title":"Psalms 102:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>I said. 39:13; Isa 38:10-22 thy years. 12; 9:7; 90:1,2; Hab 1:12; Re 1:4,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-25","title":"Psalms 102:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Ge 1:1; 2:1; Ex 20:11; Job 38:4-7; Pr 8:23-36; Jer 32:17 Heb 1:10-12; 3:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-26","title":"Psalms 102:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>They shall. Isa 34:4; 51:6; 65:17; 66:22; Lu 21:33; Ro 8:20; 2Pe 3:7-12 Re 20:11; 21:1 endure. Heb. stand. 12; Ex 3:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-27","title":"Psalms 102:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>thou art. Mal 3:6; Joh 8:58; Heb 13:8; Jas 1:17; Re 1:8,17,18 years. 90:4; Job 36:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-102-28","title":"Psalms 102:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":102,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":102,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>The children. 22:30,31; 45:16,17; 69:35,36; Isa 53:10; 59:20,21; 65:22; 66:22 their seed. 90:16,17</p>"}]}